  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SLB-TB - Solomon Islands (01-Jan-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands, Tuberculosis, Solomon Islands Ministry of Health and Medical Services (MHMS)This program has the following goals: Reduce the burden of TB and TB/HIV co-infection in Solomon Islands. The objectives of this program are: Address HIV/TB, MDR TB and vulnerable groups such as contacts, diabetics and prisoners.  Empower people and communities living with tuberculosis.  Engage all health care providers to achieve better tuberculosis care.  Pursue high quality DOTS expansion and enhancement</narrative>
  </description>
